the-firm-as-one-program-29 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-29 = unlines (cons "- **C6** Exact reasoning under partial observation, and the value of information can be computed ([P1: Observation fibers: what a reading warrants, and when a participant is safe to act (hyperactivity v31 §1, §10.4)])." (cons "  A market maker never sees the true state of the market; it sees its fills, the public book and the tape. The fiber of states compatible with those observations is the exact object its decisions should rest on, and an action is safe when it is safe for every state in that fiber. Because refining an observation shrinks the fiber, the value of a new data source becomes computable: it is how much that source shrinks the fibers on which decisions depend. Data purchased today by intuition can be priced before it is bought." nil))
